  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Well, if it ain’t that kid from Team MZ.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C006C002C002000690066002000690074002000610069006E20190074002000740068006100740020006B00690064002000660072006F006D0020005400650061006D0020004D005A002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You got a bit of a reputation in the Rust Syndicate.\nI hear you’re pretty strong.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battle me, will you? Don’t have to be right now—\nI can wait till you’re good and ready.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Come talk to me once you’re in the mood for a\nbattle, MZ grunt.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006D0065002000740061006C006B00200074006F0020006D00650020006F006E0063006500200079006F007520190072006500200069006E00200074006800650020006D006F006F006400200066006F007200200061000A0062006100740074006C0065002C0020004D005A0020006700720075006E0074002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You seem ready. Wanna get this started?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007300650065006D002000720065006100640079002E002000570061006E006E006100200067006500740020007400680069007300200073007400610072007400650064003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s battle",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200062006100740074006C00650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not right now",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00740020007200690067006800740020006E006F00770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then buckle up! My will is hard as steel, y’hear?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E0020006200750063006B006C006500200075007000210020004D0079002000770069006C006C0020006900730020006800610072006400200061007300200073007400650065006C002C0020007920190068006500610072003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You messin’ with me, kid? If you ain’t ready to\nbattle, don’t talk to me in the first place!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y’know, you’re all right. Most folks wouldn’t\nwaste time humorin’ me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00592019006B006E006F0077002C00200079006F007520190072006500200061006C006C002000720069006700680074002E0020004D006F0073007400200066006F006C006B007300200077006F0075006C0064006E20190074000A00770061007300740065002000740069006D0065002000680075006D006F00720069006E20190020006D0065002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guess I owe you somethin’ interesting since I lost\nthe battle. Lemme tell you a little secret.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Steel can’t be poisoned!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007400650065006C002000630061006E2019007400200062006500200070006F00690073006F006E006500640021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, that’s true even for people. Word is that back\nwhen he was young, our very own Philippe was<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nawed by an even younger man—Corbeau.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The thing about Corbeau is that he’s charismatic,\ncharmin’, just downright intoxicatin’.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd that’s rad! But it can work against him, too.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So Philippe looks to Skarmory as a reminder. It\nhelps him keep a level head and stops him from<U+0010><U+0001>븀\njust blindly following Corbeau.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "None of this is high-stakes intel, mind you, but I\nlike talkin’ about it anyway.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s ’cause our second-in-command has such a\nsolid head on his shoulders that grunts like us<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncan sleep easy.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 200
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Here, take this. Thanks for the battle, and for\nlistenin’ to me prattle on.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If Corbeau’s taken you under his wing, then that\nmakes us family, MZ grunt!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If Corbeau’s taken you under his wing, then that\nmakes us family, MZ grunt!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
